<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκ-τρέχω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δρᾰμοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1086
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεξέδρᾰμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.156
				</span></i>
			:—<i>run out from under, escape from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παρεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλπος οὐχ ὑπεκδραμεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὴν σὴν . .
			γλωσσαλγίαν</span> (where the metaph. is taken from a ship)
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				524
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς ὑπεκδραμούμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					873
				</span></i>
			: abs., of horses, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Eum.</u>
				7
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν ἐγὼ μὴ θανεῖν ὑπεκδράμω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run out beyond,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χρόνου τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					167
				</span></i>
			.</div>
